@orz/themes

The Pro themes (src/themes/pro-*.ts, with src/prohibitorum.ts) contain colour
values from Prohibitorum, https://github.com/TundraWork/Prohibitorum,
dashboard/src/styles/theme.css and schemes.css at commit 6d3bc42, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0 in this package).

They were modified: each value was resolved as a browser resolves it and
stored as opaque hex, mapped onto this package's tokens, and the field edge,
chart, diff and terminal colours, which Prohibitorum does not define, were
derived from them.

